title: Talia
---
<<wait 0.1>>
<<if $day == 1>>
    <<jump Talia_Day1>>
<<elseif $day == 2>>
    <<jump Talia_Day2>>
<<elseif $day == 3>>
    <<jump Talia_Day2>>
<<elseif $day == 4>>
    <<jump Talia_Day2>>
<<elseif $day == 5>>
    <<jump Talia_Day5>>
<<endif>>
===

title: Talia_Day1
---
Talia: Hey Ernest! I'm glad I brought my deck of cards. We should definitely play later.
<<if $talkedToTalia == false>>
    <<set $talkedToTalia = true>>
    <<set $peopleMet = $peopleMet + 1>>
<<endif>>
===

title: Talia_Day2
---
Talia: Hey Ernest! Would you like to play solitaire with me?
    -> Ernest: Yes
        <<set $playSolitaire = true>>
    -> Ernest: Maybe later
===

title: Talia_Day5
---
Talia: Hey Ernest, I'm all done packing up. Do you have time for one more solitaire game? 
    -> Ernest: Yes 
        <<set $playSolitaire = true>>
    -> Ernest: No 
        Ernest: Sorry Talia, I have a little bit more to do. 
        Talia: That's ok! Maybe you can come back later!  
===
